---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="IB Exam Strategy Guide | Free Paper 1, 2, 3 & IA Tips"
  description="Complete IB exam strategy guide with paper 1, 2, 3 and IA tips. Free download for IB students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>IB Exam<br><span>Strategy Guide</span></h1>
    <p>Paper 1, 2, 3 and IA tips. Maximize your IB score with proven strategies.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>General Strategy</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Time Management</h3>
        <pre><code>Paper 1: 1 mark per minute
Paper 2: 1 mark per minute
Paper 3: 1.5 marks per minute

Read all questions first (5 min)
Plan answers before writing
Save 10 min for review</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Command Words</h3>
        <pre><code>State: Give a fact
Describe: What happens
Explain: Why/How (use theory)
Discuss: Give multiple perspectives
Evaluate: Weigh evidence, make judgment</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Paper 1 (Multiple Choice)</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Strategy</h3>
        <pre><code>• 45 questions in 1 hour
• 1 mark per question
• No penalty for guessing
• Eliminate obviously wrong answers
• Watch for "NOT" or "EXCEPT"
• Check units in calculations</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Paper 2 (Short Answer)</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Strategy</h3>
        <pre><code>• 15 questions in 1 hour
• Mixed difficulty
• Show all working
• Use correct significant figures
• Include units in final answer
• Answer what is asked, not what you know</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Paper 3 (Extended Response)</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Strategy</h3>
        <pre><code>• Data-based questions
• Analyze graphs carefully
• Use data to support arguments
• Refer to specific evidence
• Show calculations clearly
• Write in full sentences</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Internal Assessment (IA)</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Criteria</h3>
        <pre><code>Personal Engagement (2 marks)
Exploration (6 marks)
Analysis (6 marks)
Evaluation (6 marks)
Communication (6 marks)

Total: 26 marks (20% of final grade)</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
